WEBVTT

00:00.250 --> 00:01.469
Hey, this is Taylor

00:01.489 --> 00:04.810
from AI Freelancer and I hate making these videos.

00:04.830 --> 00:06.270
It's really hard to be genuine

00:06.290 --> 00:08.380
and not be like a marketing guy

00:08.400 --> 00:10.120
and just a weird vibe.

00:10.140 --> 00:11.259
But I wanted to tell you

00:11.279 --> 00:12.440
about AI Freelancer.

00:12.460 --> 00:15.800
AI Freelancer is my attempt to help the world

00:15.820 --> 00:17.200
benefit from AI.

00:17.220 --> 00:18.850
Now, personally speaking,

00:18.870 --> 00:21.870
I think all this AI stuff is being kind

00:21.890 --> 00:24.069
of forced on the public a bit too fast,

00:24.089 --> 00:26.200
and I'm honestly not wild

00:26.220 --> 00:28.659
about a lot of these AI companies

00:28.679 --> 00:30.440
and the social impacts

00:30.460 --> 00:31.709
that they are having.

00:31.729 --> 00:34.100
But there is incredible science here

00:34.120 --> 00:35.459
and you can do so much good

00:35.479 --> 00:36.570
with the science.

00:36.590 --> 00:38.250
And I really view it as my mission to

00:38.270 --> 00:39.720
try and help people dig deep

00:39.740 --> 00:42.200
and find what can really move the needle

00:42.220 --> 00:42.739
for them.

00:42.759 --> 00:43.860
You know, it's not easy.

00:43.880 --> 00:45.359
There's a million things going on.

00:45.379 --> 00:47.120
I don't think the world has ever been changing

00:47.140 --> 00:47.910
this fast.

00:47.930 --> 00:49.170
I don't think people like it.

00:49.190 --> 00:50.370
I'm going to do what I can to help,

00:50.390 --> 00:50.840
though.
